tive calories, the current heart rate, the average pace, and the elevation.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8de838390249b16301bfc5495947da37/workouts-metrics%402x.png","line":25,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the rightmost Workout screen, which shows information about the music currently playing.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/acc22020a6613bd6558ce8ea836aa156/workouts-media-playback%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":42,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":43,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/workouts#Platform-considerations","line":53},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/workouts#Resources","line":57},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/workouts#Related","line":59},{"title":"Activity rings","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/activity-rings","line":61},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/workouts#Developer-documentation","line":63},{"title":"WorkoutKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WorkoutKit","line":65},{"title":"Workouts and activity rings","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/HealthKit/workouts-and-activity-rings",